{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free demo version of <strong>Desktop Slippers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a desktop idle game that lives in a corner of your screen. Inside it, a pair of slippers roams around, chasing down bugs and earning you a steady stream of rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t control the action, you simply watch it unfold. Upgrade your slippers, and enjoy the oddly satisfying bug chase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s in the Demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full idle experience with roaming slippers and bug chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All upgrades currently available in the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop-corner presentation identical to the full release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo limit on total money</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155960/extras/3a88f8c6f5f46dbae3879b1906839717.poster.avif?t=1762785359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155960/extras/3a88f8c6f5f46dbae3879b1906839717.webm?t=1762785359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155960/extras/3a88f8c6f5f46dbae3879b1906839717.mp4?t=1762785359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155960?t=1762785359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155960?t=1762785359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155960/2679cb1130f81982d20aa5cd51bf6ec6fe8e19a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762785359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as